## Extraction Rules

- Return only facts explicitly shown in a figure, legend, axis label, inset, or figure caption.
- `location.source_type` must be `"figure"` or `"caption"`.
- `location.page` is required and must be a positive integer.
- `location.figure_or_table` should identify the figure label when available, such as `"Fig. 2"` or `"Figure 3"`.
- `location.evidence` must quote exact visible text from the caption or figure whenever possible.
- If a numeric value is estimated from a plotted point or curve, only include it when the figure makes the value clear enough to state directly.
- `material_or_system` should be a fully resolved stoichiometric formula when the figure/caption makes it explicit.

