## Required Process

1. Read `{figure_inventory_path}` first to understand which crops exist.
2. Inspect the relevant image files directly before extracting any value.
3. Prefer figure-supported superconducting properties such as Tc, gaps, fields, coherence lengths, penetration depths, or lattice values when they are actually visible.
4. Omit unsupported properties rather than guessing.

Save the JSON to `{predictions_path}` and print only the JSON as your final response.
